      {
        "img": "assets/level_demo/l3_frame_1.svg",
        "who": "tremu",
        "text": "A third way that stress can come up is through our THOUGHTS. Stress can change how you think."
      },
      {
        "img": "assets/level_demo/l3_frame_2.svg",
        "who": "tremu",
        "text": "Your mind might feel foggy or confused."
      },
      {
        "img": "assets/level_demo/l3_frame_3.svg",
        "who": "tremu",
        "text": "Things you know might suddenly become hard to remember."
      },
      {
        "img": "assets/level_demo/l3_frame_4.svg",
        "who": "tremu",
        "text": "Or, you might imagine something bad will happen if you try, which makes you want to give up before you even start."
      },
      {
        "img": "assets/level_demo/l3_frame_5.svg",
        "who": "tremu",
        "text": "But remember, this is just thought stress. It can feel big and scary, but we are strong and we can absolutely overcome it."
      },
      {
        "img": "assets/level_demo/l3_frame_6.svg",
        "who": "tremu",
        "text": "Even the mightiest forest creatures feel stress feelings. If we know how to spot them, then we can choose to focus on more helpful thoughts instead."
      }
    ]
